{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281180","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1028118001:0":{"text":"휴윈, 왜 대답하지 않는 거야?!","source_cn":"伊温，你为什么不回答我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x228C472D8FAB9E22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028118002:0":{"text":"프라벨?","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x125174165CD7D3E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028118003:0":{"text":"뭐, 대답할 필요도 없겠지. 넌 연인의 소원을 나설 용기가 없으니까. 안 그래? 이 겁쟁이!","source_cn":"不用你回答我也知道，你没有胆量踏出情人之愿，对不对？因...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC7C6A84EB120BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028118004:0":{"text":"네 나약함 때문에 많은 걸 잃어버린 거야. 이르군도, 연인의 소원의 풍경도, 타란 마을의 모든 생명들도...","source_cn":"就是因为懦弱，你才会一直失去，伊尔贡，情人之愿的风景，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8971E8E329A49034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028118005:0":{"text":"프라벨... 갑, 갑자기 왜 그래? 어디 아파?","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔……你、你怎么了？你不舒服吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3BD3EFCC2133880","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028118006:0":{"text":"넌 너무 나약해. 언젠가 그것 때문에 모든 걸 잃게 될 거야! 결국 돌이킬 수 없겠지!","source_cn":"你太弱小了，总有一天你会因此失去一切，无法挽回！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x992B2614C43DF4B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028118007:1":{"text":"아, 아니야... 프라벨...","source_cn":"不、不是的……芙拉贝尔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FA8865C2683B7BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028118008:0":{"text":"마스터, 휴윈 양의 기억이... 뭔가 잘못된 게 아닐까요? 프라벨은 이렇게 냉혹한 사람이 아니에요!","source_cn":"主人，伊温小姐的回忆……是不是哪里出错了？芙拉贝尔明明...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2ABB9C081AD48CB0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 휴윈 양의 기억이... 뭔가 잘못된 게 아닐까요? 프라벨은 이렇게 냉혹한 사람이 아니에요!","female":"마스터, 휴윈 양의 기억이... 뭔가 잘못된 게 아닐까요? 프라벨은 이렇게 냉혹한 사람이 아니에요!","variant_male_record_index":"110817","variant_female_record_index":"110818","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028118009:0":{"text":"이게 진짜 기억인가요?","source_cn":"那是真实的记忆吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x952E50E231EEBEA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1028118009":{"text":"이게 진짜 기억인가요?","source_cn":"那是真实的记忆吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x952E50E231EEBEA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028118010:0":{"text":"제 기억 속의... 프라벨은 이런 말 한 적 없어요... 절대로요!","source_cn":"那段回忆……芙拉贝尔没有那么说过……绝对没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC4E09E3BFCBD00B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028118011:0":{"text":"이건 가짜예요... 기억이 왜곡됐어요!","source_cn":"那是假的……是被扭曲了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6B5E8D9BB50134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028118014:2":{"text":"크아아아앙!","source_cn":"噢噢噢噢噢——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x111E7525E4276456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028118015:0":{"text":"휴윈 양, 오염에 조심하세요. 완전히 오염되면 기억의 조각이 깨질 거예요!","source_cn":"伊温小姐，不要被污染影响了，控制好它，不然你的记忆碎片...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF8EBE8DDF9E4392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028118016:0":{"text":"걱정 마세요! 치피가 몬스터를 막아서 휴윈 양을 안전하게 지킬게요!","source_cn":"别担心，我们来挡住魔物，绝对不会让它们再影响到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBE054688CA7FF83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1